  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://erlangen-crm.org/240307/P16_used_specific_object">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
    <rdfs:comment>In GOLEM, indicates that an object (G16) is used in a narrative event (G5), or a source is used in an observation or inference process (E13).</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dlp/CommonSenseMapping.owl#collection-role">
    <rdfs:comment>A role only played by collections.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/ont/dlp/ExtendedDnS.owl#reconstructed-flux">
    <rdfs:comment>Reconstructed fluxes are fluxes that only contain accomplishments as members.</rdfs:comment>
  </rdf:Description>
